            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Note Ferry 1.2 adds a choice of summarizers: Apple Intelligence on compatible Macs, your signed-in Codex account, or a separately billed Claude API key. A first-run screen chooses the default; the picker beside Summarize & format changes it for one text. Format only still runs locally without AI.

Apple Intelligence is the initial choice on a new install and remains experimental. Review names, attribution, and follow-ups, especially in long transcripts. Claude keys are stored in this Mac's Keychain and sent only after a first-use confirmation.
]]></description>
