            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Note Ferry 1.1 adds in-app update checks through Sparkle. You can choose Check for Updates from the Note Ferry menu. On the second launch, the app asks whether it may check automatically in the background.

The rest of the app still formats text locally or summarizes it with your Codex account when you choose that action.
]]></description>
